# The build needs the manifest, the lockfile, src/, the packages/ workspace
# and the dummy config. Keeping everything else out means a docs edit does not
# invalidate the dependency layer.
*

!package.json
!bun.lock
!src
!packages
# Just the manifest — bun's frozen-lockfile check needs every workspace to be
# present, but this image never runs apps/web, so nothing else from it goes in.
!apps/web/package.json
!data/washy-washy.json.dist
